THOUGHT 1: The detection call failed due to a remote/API error. I'll retry detection but wrap it in try/except. If detection fails again, I'll fall back to sliding_window_detection to search smaller patches. If that also fails, I'll display the original image for manual inspection so we can proceed without the remote detector.

